        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "s8qxxxL",
          "x": 84,
          "y": 3348,
          "name": "Notes",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 5440,
          "content": "• All figures are re-posed cut-paper puppets of the existing prop_lampiao, prop_maria_bonita and prop_cacador art (same costume, carving, proportions); missing parts (profile/back views, coffee pot, cup, log, ash pile) drawn in the same carving.\n• 4-pose sheets 1024x1024, 2x2 reading order, feet on the existing anim_*_walk per-cell line: y=428 in the top row, y=940 in the bottom row (anim_onca_walk sits at 427/898). Each cell centred on x=256 / 768.\n• anim_lampiao_walk, anim_maria_walk, anim_cacador_walk: the source figures are frontal, so the walks keep the frontal costume with stepping legs and swinging arms rather than a strict right profile. Lampião carries the hurricane lamp in his left hand (screen right); the caçador carries the rifle on his shoulder.\n• anim_cacador_run: leaning forward, arms pumping, facing right. anim_cacador_panic: running right with head turned back over the shoulder, mouth open. Both read as 4-frame loops.\n• anim_cacador_burning: arms thrown up → flailing → bent double → staggering; vest/coat edges cut into shreds. No fire drawn on him (fire is a separate layer).\n• anim_couple_xote: Lampião and Maria as ONE figure, cheek to cheek, a gentle sway loop with alternating steps and the skirt swinging; the motion is subtle by design (a close xote, not a spin).\n• pose_lampiao_aim / pose_lampiao_fire 600x800: rifle shouldered with one eye closed; fire = same pose with the muzzle kicked up and the head turned slightly. Swap the two for the shot; S11 shot_flash anchors at the muzzle tip (upper right of the rifle).\n• pose_cacador_aim 600x800: rifle level to the right. pose_cacador_fall 800x600: toppling backward, rifle flying off to the upper right; one heel on the ground line.\n• pose_cacador_ash 800x300: a low ash mound in the outline of the fallen figure, his hat on the head end (left); swap in where pose_cacador_fall lands (head left).\n• pose_couple_embrace 700x800: standing side by side, holding each other. pose_maria_coffee 600x800: pot tipped in her left hand pouring into a cup in her right.\n• pose_couple_fire 800x500: the two seated side by side on a log (log included in the asset), facing the viewer; place the fire to the right/front.\n• pose_jump_fire 600x700: Lampião mid-leap to the right, arms flung, scarf and bandolier flying; trailing toe on the 92% line so it sits on the same ground as the others.\n• pose_maria_wipe 600x800: Maria seen from behind (hair, hat back, bandoliers crossed), right arm raised with an open palm and a carved arc showing the circular wipe on the glass.\n• Nothing missing: all 17 S8 assets present.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
