        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "s10qxxbf",
          "x": 84,
          "y": 4120,
          "name": "Notes",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 5180,
          "content": "• festa_bunting and festa_fence tile horizontally (no 2 px border on the left/right edges).\n• Standing props (bonfire, pole, table, corn, musicians, house, chapel, fence, balloon) sit on the ground line at 92% of their frame height.\n• festa_bonfire is unlit (the game adds fire). festa_stained_glass: lead lines are ink, panes transparent.\n• festa_balloon_folded is the collapsed paper balloon before it is filled; festa_flag_1..3 are flat / rippled / folded over.\n• The forró trio are ordinary sertão musicians built from the S8 figure rig, without bandoliers or rifles.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
