        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "s11qxxxH",
          "x": 84,
          "y": 2244,
          "name": "Notes",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1760,
          "content": "• All 15 S11 assets present (flash, smoke, spark and dust each _1..3, plus trail, bullet, shell). Nothing missing.\n• Neutral solid Ink, every carved line cut out; transparent backgrounds; 2 px border kept on every asset; nothing tiles.\n• shot_flash_1..3 (512): a star burst of uneven tapered spikes fanning to the RIGHT from a small round core with a carved ring of gouges. Muzzle anchor = the core centre at about (92, 256) (±6 px per variant): put it on the gun muzzle, the burst points along the shot.\n• shot_smoke_1..3 (400): rolling clumps of round lobes, each with a carved spiral, a few detached curls around them; three different clump shapes for alternation or growth.\n• shot_trail (1024x256): spiral-smoke lobes, thick at the left (x≈36, the muzzle end) tapering right into wind-gust-like strands and small curls (to x≈996). Anchor the left end at the muzzle, after the flash.\n• shot_bullet (512x64): a small slug with a rounded nose at the right (tip x≈504, y≈32), a carved gap, then a long streak tapering to a point on the left, with thin speed lines. Direction of travel = right; mirror for left. HEAVY-based widths (FINE/MEDIUM fall under 1.5 px at S=64).\n• shot_shell (64x24): a spent brass casing lying on its side, tilted 10°, rim at left and open mouth at right, with an extractor groove and a highlight line cut out; widths HEAVY-based (minimum cut about 1.5 to 2 px).\n• shot_spark_1..3 (256): a small radial burst of short blunt lines around a tiny four-point star, with a few flying chips; centre ≈ (128, 128) = the impact point.\n• shot_dust_1..3 (256x160): a low puff of dust lobes with carved spirals and stipple, pebbles thrown around; lowest ink exactly on the 92% ground line (y=147.2) with a thin ground scuff, so they stand on the same floor line as the props.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
