        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "s13qxxeP",
          "x": 84,
          "y": 3236,
          "name": "Notes",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 3880,
          "content": "• Colour layers per frame paint in order (paper, ink, amber, ember, heart, leaf); Amber/Ember/Heart only for fire, light and active states.\n• ui_bookmark_N_on is the Amber-lit active tab; ui_bookmark_N_off plain paper.\n• ui_progress, ui_drawer and the ribbons are nine-slice friendly: decorated ends/corners, plain repeatable middle; ribbon text areas are left empty for the verses.\n• Instruments: needles and moving marks are separate colour layers inside the asset; ui_viscosity_1..3 are labelled RALO / MÉDIO / GROSSO.\n• Not made: the optional ui_canvas 1920x1080 composite (the reviewer did not finish); every asset in the brief is present.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
